   "w": 300,
   "h": 202,
   "title": "\u26a0\ufe0f SHOPIFY PUSH IS BLOCKED",
   "text": "The Shopify connector token expired mid-run and the local shpat_ token in theme-build/_build/upload.py is dead. push_shopify.py is written and dry-run tested \u2014 re-authorize the Shopify connector and it runs in one command. It prints the old->new mapping first and only writes on --commit.",
   "color": "#f7f5ee",
   "id": "c090"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "x": 320,
   "y": 2377,
   "w": 300,
   "h": 183,
   "title": "ALT TEXT IS LOAD-BEARING",
   "text": "Every gallery alt carries a #color_<slug> suffix that the PDP colour filter keys off. The pusher COPIES the alt from the media it replaces rather than composing a new one. Shopify cannot replace an image in place, so alt and position are both re-established by hand.",
   "color": "#f7f5ee",
   "id": "c091"
  },
  {
   "type": "note",
   "x": 640,
   "y": 2377,
   "w": 300,
   "h": 240,
   "title": "NEW LAW \u2014 crop shots get a crop block, never the identity block",
   "text": "The first roll of 03-interior and 04-hardware came back as ordinary front packshots in all six frames. Cause: the full head-to-toe identity block is appended to every prompt and it overrode the crop. Fix: framing FIRST, a block describing only what is inside the frame, and an explicit list of the parts that are outside it. Worked on all 10 rolls.",
   "color": "#f7f5ee",
   "id": "c092"
  },
